## One-page design note (I2) — DE pocket card
```
run_check_path(fs, sys, root):
  paths = collect_module_paths(fs, root)   # deps-first
  if len(paths) > MAX_MODS: ERR import/check module count; exit 1
  table = empty binds
  for p in paths:
    body = strip_import_lines(read(p))
    table = table + fn_names(body) as name@0
  for p in paths:
    body = strip_import_lines(read(p))
    mk = check_cache_mod_key(hash(body))
    if all modules use cache: if hit(mk): continue
    typecheck unit(body, extra_binds=table)  # local lines
    put(mk)
  put(check_cache_tree_key(hash(ordered path:body hashes)))
  print OK
```

Path-A residual callout in header of `check_mod.oo` after land:
“Modular unit check = names (+ optional stubs). Not full export-type lattice.”

end of r2_ideas.oot
